<title>USA: TABLE - Trion Inc Q2 shr slips.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Trion Inc Q2 shr slips.</headline>
<dateline>SANFORD, N.C. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended   Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				   June 30		 June 30</p>
<p>			  1997	  1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>				   (Restated)		  (Restated)</p>
<p> Sales	  $17,757,000 $16,922,000 $31,329,000 $33,791,000</p>
<p> Net Income	 501,000     702,000     507,000   1,276,000</p>
<p>Net Income Per Share</p>
<p>			   0.07	  0.10	  0.07	  0.19</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings restated to include results of Herrmidifier Co Inc, acquired by Trion in August 1996. Co said Q2 1997 includes one-time start-up costs that shaved about $0.01 to $0.02 per share off earnings.</p>
<p>	 ---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
